# Build context: keep it small and keep secrets out.
#
# Note that data/ is NOT excluded wholesale: the runtime image copies six
# specific files out of it. Excluding the directory would silently make those
# COPY lines fail (or, worse, ship an image with no metrics).

.git/
.github/
.husky/
venv/
node_modules/
dashboard/node_modules/
cli/node_modules/
repos/
mlruns/
data/archive/
data/graph_snapshots/
data/*.db
data/*.backup*
tests/
docs/
smoke_tests/
dashboard/dist/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.log
.env
.env.*
mlflow.db*
mlflow.db.bak
